This licence covers the code in this repository.

The datasets in data/raw/ were supplied as teaching materials for COMP20008 at
the University of Melbourne and are derived from Victorian Government open
data, including the Crime Statistics Agency of Victoria. They remain subject to
their original publishers' terms and are not licensed by this file. See
data/README.md.

The analysis in report/COMP20008_A2-Report.pdf is the collective work of
Group W05G1: Emerson Leishman, Jason Jiang, Benedict Yong and Zhengrong Yan.
